<text x="-48.26" y="-75.438" size="0.8128" layer="21">Documentation can be found here:</text>
<text x="-48.768" y="-90.932" size="1.778" layer="21">The PORTMASTER</text>
<text x="-129.794" y="-24.13" size="1.778" layer="21">+</text>
<text x="-129.794" y="-34.29" size="1.778" layer="21">+</text>
<text x="-129.286" y="-28.194" size="1.778" layer="21">-</text>
<text x="-129.286" y="-37.846" size="1.778" layer="21">-</text>
<text x="-129.54" y="-165.354" size="1.778" layer="21">-</text>
<text x="-129.54" y="-176.53" size="1.778" layer="21">-</text>
